{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手楊千嬅去年在廣州開騷，曾請來衛蘭擔任嘉賓，衛蘭卻撈亂了對方的經典歌《少女的祈禱》及《野孩子》，講成《少女的孩子》，千嬅更聽成《少女的提子》，隨即笑到趴低。</p><p>近日輪到衛蘭在紅館開騷，楊千嬅亦於尾場捧場，更踩入後台跟衛蘭互動。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:03:54.339262+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T09:29:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:57:13.032714+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T09:57:13.032714+00:00","content_hash":"6c012f13eeca543c0bca7a8cc4131561e7c4366203d041cf9aaa70d85d6ee722","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}